<% title "Terms of Service" %>
<section class="md-section">
  <div class="md-section__inner md-stack">
    <p class="md-section__eyebrow">PokéMart</p>
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p><strong>Test-only demo — not a live store.</strong> PokéMart is a demonstration storefront. No real money changes hands: checkout runs a local test simulator, no card data is collected or stored, and no payment is processed.</p>
    <h2>1. The service</h2>
    <p>PokéMart lets you browse a demo Pokémon card catalog and simulate a purchase. Cards, sets, rarities, and prices are sample data for display; nothing you buy here is shipped or fulfilled.</p>
    <h2>2. Demo purchase</h2>
    <p>Checkout asks only for an email address and completes through a local simulator. A receipt page is available through a signed, expiring link sent to that email. No payment details are requested or stored.</p>
    <h2>3. No affiliation</h2>
    <p>Pokémon is a trademark of Nintendo / Creatures Inc. / GAME FREAK inc. PokéMart is an independent demo and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by The Pokémon Company, Nintendo, or any card publisher.</p>
    <h2>4. Operator details</h2>
    <p>This demo is operated by the PokéMart maintainers for evaluation purposes. The following must be completed before any production launch: a named legal entity, a registered address and jurisdiction, a monitored support mailbox, and reviewed terms. Until then this service is explicitly test-only.</p>
    <h2>5. Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this demo: <a href="mailto:support@pokemart.api.holode.xyz">support@pokemart.api.holode.xyz</a>.</p>
    <p><em>Version 1.0 — August 2026.</em></p>
  </div>
</section>
